WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.440
You have nothing.

00:01.440 --> 00:03.320
You are nothing.

00:03.320 --> 00:06.700
You are wickedness, you are jealousy, you are envy,

00:06.700 --> 00:08.620
you are hatred.

00:08.620 --> 00:09.860
You are nothing.

00:09.860 --> 00:11.480
You can build nothing.

00:11.480 --> 00:13.680
You can produce nothing.

00:13.680 --> 00:16.460
You can create nothing.

00:16.460 --> 00:18.160
We are the ones who build.

00:18.160 --> 00:20.240
We are the ones who create.

00:20.240 --> 00:23.760
We are the ones who lift up humanity.

